StayWise – Customer Churn Prediction System


Overview

StayWise is a machine learning-based web application that predicts customer churn probability.
It helps organizations identify customers who are likely to leave and take preventive actions.

The system is built using Python, Flask, and a Random Forest model, with a modern web interface for user interaction.


Features

Customer churn prediction using machine learning

Interactive web interface

Prediction visualization using charts

Prediction history stored using SQLite

Analytics dashboard (churn vs retention)

Responsive UI design


Tech Stack

Backend: Python (Flask)

Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript

Machine Learning: Scikit-learn (Random Forest)

Database: SQLite

Visualization: Chart.js


